WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.120
[Several pairs of eyes appear.]

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:02.590
[Maxwell:] Come on.

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:05.520
[Music]

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.680
[Maxwell:] Come on, it's only a bird.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.570
[Animals in the woods howl at the children who are exploring.]

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:12.280
[Joe:] What kind of bird is that, Maxwell?

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.060
[Maxwell:] That's only a cat.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.620
[Peter:] Hey, I think I see a clearing, let's go.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.400
[Drums roll.]

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:27.020
[Maxwell:] Watch it! My toes! We're almost there.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:29.200
[The boys continue into the forest.]

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.300
We made it.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:36.060
[Peter:] Forty days of hiking through this jungle. I wish I were home in bed.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.890
[Joe:] Are you sure we're not lost, Maxwell?

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:43.100
[Maxwell:] Impossible, get out the map, Peter.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:49.340
We started here... and now we're here, I think.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:52.900
And if my calculations are correct,

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:59.340
today we should reach the fabulous lost civilization of NO-DE-KAY.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:02.460
[Peter and Joe:] NO-DE-KAY!

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:05.340
[Maxwell:] Let's get going then, before night falls.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.300
[A tree with a snake appears out of nowhere.]

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.780
[Peter:] What's that?

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.300
[Maxwell:] A crawling vine.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.510
[Peter:] With a head?

00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:16.350
[Maxwell:] Sure with a head, didn't you ever hear of a head of lettuce? Well, same thing.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:19.250
[Peter:] Do you see anything, Maxwell?

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.820
[Maxwell:] I see it, I see it, a huge mountain.

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:23.490
[Joe:] What's so special about that?

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:28.580
[Maxwell:] I see the mountain of DE-KAY and alongside it are inscriptions.

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:32.710
It's the land of NO-DE-KAY! Let's go, men.

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:34.890
Wow, what a big mouth!

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:36.640
[Joe:] Big teeth too.

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:39.100
[Peter:] I'm scared Maxwell, you go first.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.620
[Maxwell:] Some adventurers you guys turned out to be.

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:42.960
[Jaw clamps down.]

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:46.800
[Joe:] Now you've done it, Maxwell. Now we're trapped.

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:50.860
[Peter:] I wish I was home in bed.

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:55.840
[All three kids:] Wow! Wow, what teeth!

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:59.190
[Peter:] They must be the people of NO-DE-KAY.

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:01.350
[Maxwell:] Look! Joe, Peter.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.790
[Joe and Peter:] What is it?

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:05.850
[Maxwell:] I don't know, but it's got rubies.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:10.650
[Peter:] Hieroglyphics. I brought along a dictionary of hieroglyphics.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:13.380
I think I can translate.

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:19.510
[Maxwell:] If you do, then we may uncover the key to the great civilization of NO-DE-KAY.

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:26.180
[Peter:] Hot, Sot, Money, Pot. Cleaning, it means cleaning.

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:35.920
Gummy, Gub, Rubby, Tub. That's it, it's a toothbrush, and the secret of NO-DE-KAY is brushing your teeth.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:39.480
[Maxwell and Joe:] Brushing your teeth!?

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:43.080
[Peter:] That's the secret of NO-DE-KAY. Get it?

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:46.000
Let's take it down, fellas.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:51.700
[Joe:] I'll get it. Hey, it's magic. It's getting smaller.

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:53.510
[Peter:] Now we can use it.

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:54.790
[Joe:] I'll use it.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:55.870
[Maxwell:] Use it on me.

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:57.700
[Joe:] Some sport.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:59.990
[Maxwell:] It's my discovery.

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:09.430
[Peter:] It says bakalakawa. Place the side of the brush against the teeth like this.

00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:18.030
Boola boola, rotate the bristles in the same direction toward the end of the teeth.

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:24.870
[Joe:] Rotate the bristles in the same direction toward the end of the teeth.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:29.110
[Peter:] Heebie jeebies. Brush down on the uppers.

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:32.430
[Joe:] Brush down on the uppers.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:36.470
[Peter:] Jeebie heebie. And up on the lowers.

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:39.090
[Joe:] And up on the lowers.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:43.830
[Peter:] Chewy gooey. And brush the chewing surfaces.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:46.350
[Joe:] Brush the chewing surfaces.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:50.490
[Peter:] Fooey fooey. And brush the inside too.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.920
[Joe:] And brush the inside too.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.000
[A snake appears to the right of the boys.]

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:54.800
[Maxwell:] Ummummurum

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.260
[Joe:] What is it, Maxwell?

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:58.210
[Maxwell:] Quick, let's get out of here.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:01.130
[Joe:] Gee, your teeth are white.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.270
You better lead the way, Maxwell.

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:04.630
[Maxwell:] How do you get out of here?

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:06.940
[Peter:] I wish I were home in bed.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:10.120
[Maxwell:] Look, the mouth of the cave is open again.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.880
Maybe we can make it.

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.620
[Crowd noise.]

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:16.380
[Maxwell:] Hip hip!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.640
[Joe and Peter:] Hooray!

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:18.770
[Maxwell:] Hip hip!

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:20.090
[Joe and Peter:] Hooray!

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:20.980
[Maxwell:] Hip hip!

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:22.340
[Joe and Peter:] Hooray!

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:28.000
[Music]

